msgstr "Import brownfield en Boot From SAN (BFS) : découvrir et gérer les serveurs existants provisionnés BFS"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:53
msgid ""
"Support for multiple networks (VLANs) with Unmanaged Networking on a "
